 "description": "AurCore AIS4001P industrial Layer 3 PoE+ switch - 8x GbE PoE+ and 4x 10G SFP+, L3 in a fanless finned aluminium housing that clips onto a 35 mm DIN rail or screws to a wall, -40 to 75 C. The port face hangs vertically on the rail: console, two status lamps, a reset and a two-way DIP switch at the top, the RJ45 block in two columns, the SFP+ cages turned on their side below it. Dual 48-57 V DC feeds, the relay contact and the ground screw are on the top face; the DIN clip and two wall plates on the back.",
